  "label": "Fool's Gold",
  "description": "A mineral (iron pyrite) that resembles gold but is not valuable. It is used metaphorically to represent something that appears valuable but is not. In the meme, it is used to label 'tranny men as 'women'', implying they are not 'real' women, which is a false and offensive characterization.",
